flag provided but not defined: -genkeys
Usage of yggdrasil:
  -address
    	use in combination with either -useconf or -useconffile, outputs your IPv6 address
  -autoconf
    	automatic mode (dynamic IP, peer with IPv6 neighbors)
  -exportkey
    	use in combination with either -useconf or -useconffile, outputs your private key in PEM format
  -genconf
    	print a new config to stdout
  -json
    	print configuration from -genconf or -normaliseconf as JSON instead of HJSON
  -loglevel string
    	loglevel to enable (default "info")
  -logto string
    	file path to log to, "syslog" or "stdout" (default "stdout")
  -normaliseconf
    	use in combination with either -useconf or -useconffile, outputs your configuration normalised
  -publickey
    	use in combination with either -useconf or -useconffile, outputs your public key
  -subnet
    	use in combination with either -useconf or -useconffile, outputs your IPv6 subnet
  -useconf
    	read HJSON/JSON config from stdin
  -useconffile string
    	read HJSON/JSON config from specified file path
  -user string
    	user (and, optionally, group) to set UID/GID to
  -version
    	prints the version of this build
